  "title": "Cranberry-Orange Scones",
  "description": "This flavorful cranberry orange scone recipe uses buttermilk for a tender, flaky texture; drizzle on a zesty orange glaze for the perfect finishing touch.",
  "authors": [
    "Michelle Hoile"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-01-19T20:40:22-05:00",
